{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23412","headline":"闻崔十八宿予新昌弊宅时予亦宿崔家依仁新亭一宵偶同两兴暗合因而成咏聊以写怀 · 白居易","name":"闻崔十八宿予新昌弊宅时予亦宿崔家依仁新亭一宵偶同两兴暗合因而成咏聊以写怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陋巷掩弊庐，高居敞华屋。\n新昌七株松，依仁万茎竹。\n松前月台白，竹下风池绿。\n君向我斋眠，我在君亭宿。\n平生有微尚，彼此多幽独。\n何必本主人，两心聊自足。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}